## Interface: 120100, 120105
## Title: XayaUI Nameplates
## Notes: Changes to Blizzard's own nameplates: your target's health bar in a color you choose, and one button that sets Blizzard's nameplate options to match a Plater profile. Disabled until you enable it in the AddOns list, so it costs nothing until then. Shows nothing while Plater (or another nameplate addon) replaces Blizzard's plates. Needs XayaUI.
